              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
            >
              Code
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-item" id="wood-chip-monitor">
        <div class="project-label">Edge AI</div>

        <div>
          <h2>Wood-Chip Monitor: Real-Time Edge-AI Quality Evaluation</h2>

          <p>
            A portable NVIDIA Jetson and TensorRT platform that converts
            streaming RGB imagery into physical chip measurements,
            size-distribution analytics, oversize alerts, moisture estimates,
            and operator-facing decision support for biomass manufacturing.
          </p>

          <p>
