      <section class="project-item" id="plantlife365">
        <div class="project-label">Smart Agriculture</div>

        <div>
          <h2>
            PlantLife365: Multimodal Plant Health Monitoring and Decision
            Support
          </h2>

          <p>
            An IoT-enabled research platform connecting ESP32 environmental
            sensing and optional imaging with authenticated data ingestion,
            user-scoped monitoring, historical visualization, alerts, data
            export, exploratory machine-learning analytics, and an optional
            local AI assistant.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="/projects/plantlife365">Project page</a>
