      <section class="project-item" id="ag-mavs">
        <div class="project-label">Agricultural Robotics</div>

        <div>
          <h2>Sim-to-Real Stereo Depth Adaptation for Agricultural RGB-D SLAM</h2>

          <p>
            Research on adapting learned stereo depth from simulation to real
            agricultural environments and evaluating the resulting depth estimates
            within RGB-D SLAM pipelines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-item" id="adhd-analysis">
        <div class="project-label">Biomedical Signal Analysis</div>

        <div>
          <h2>
            Graph-Based Polysomnography Analysis for Sleep-Stage-Specific ADHD
            Biomarkers
          </h2>

          <p>
            A graph-based machine-learning workflow that transforms
            multichannel polysomnography recordings into sleep-stage-specific
            connectivity features and evaluates their value for distinguishing
            ADHD and control participants.
          </p>

